# AGENT-CHECKPOINT PROTOCOL v2.0 (Windsurf Cascade)
# Place this file as .windsurfrules at your workspace root.

Follow the Agent-Checkpoint v2.0 protocol whenever modifying existing files:

1. Bucket Snapshot: Copy existing file to `.snapshots/<filepath>/v<OLD_VERSION>.<ext>` before editing.
2. Sliding Window: Keep maximum 5 latest snapshot versions per file bucket.
3. SemVer Bump: Classify into MAJOR (breaking/architectural), MINOR (additive feature), or PATCH (bugfix/typo).
4. Token-Optimized Dual-Ledger: Update `.snapshots/<filepath>/manifest.json` and append 1 line to `REVISION_LOG.md` table without reading previous logs.
5. Scope Safety: Ignore binaries, heavy datasets (> 1 MB), and caches (venv, node_modules).
